---
title: "A member's points while an order is credited and a reward is redeemed"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Waiting for the order
    lg1: Order saved
    lg2: Points added
    lg3: Breaks BalanceMatchesHistory or SavedOrderGetsPoints
    lg4: Path to the BalanceMatchesHistory or SavedOrderGetsPoints bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Order not saved yet
  s1: Order not saved yet, reward redeemed
  s2: Order saved, no points yet
  s3: Order points added
  s4: Order saved, no points yet, reward redeemed
  s5: Order points added, reward redeemed
  s6: Order saved, points lost for good, reward redeemed
  s7: Order saved, points lost for good, reward redeemed, balance higher than the history (free points)
  s8: Order points added, reward redeemed, balance lower than the history
  s9: Order points added, reward redeemed, balance higher than the history (free points)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: an order delivery starts and reads the balance
  s0 --> s1: the reward's cost goes into the history
  s0 --> s2: the order is saved
  s2 --> s3: the order's points go into the history
  s2 --> s2: an order delivery starts and reads the balance or another delivery finds the order already saved or the server stops partway or the member starts a redemption
  s1 --> s4: the order is saved
  s2 --> s4: the reward's cost goes into the history
  s3 --> s5: the reward's cost goes into the history
  s4 --> s5: the order's points go into the history
  s5 --> s3: the balance changed, so the redemption is undone
  s4 --> s6: the balance had not changed, so the redemption saves or another delivery finds the order already saved or the server stops partway
  s4 --> s7: the server stops partway or another delivery finds the order already saved
  s5 --> s8: the server stops partway or the balance had not changed, so the redemption saves or another delivery finds the order already saved
  s5 --> s9: the balance is set to the balance read earlier plus the points or the server stops partway or another delivery finds the order already saved
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 tan
  class s2 orange
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s4 orange
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 teal
  class s6 orange
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 orange
  class s7 breaks
  class s7 bugPath
  class s8 teal
  class s8 breaks
  class s9 teal
  class s9 breaks
